  "description": "The Major range from Stay Strong is their larger wheeled cruiser style bikes and they come in 3 size options, 24\", 26\" & 27.5\" Notable details include a Chromoly frame, Chromoly steerer tube, Fully sealed bearings throughout, lightweight Alloy stem & sprocket and full Chromoly 3pc cranks. All 3 are spec'd with the BMXer in mind with modern geometry applied so you'll be comfortable riding the Skatepark, The streets & trails or just commuting to and from work! ###section### Product Specs FRAME MATERIAL: Chromoly top and down tube WHEEL SIZE: 26\" TOP TUBE LENGTH: 22\" CHAIN STAY LENGTH: 16.75\" HEADTUBE ANGLE: 70.5° SEAT TUBE ANGLE: 70° FORKS: Chromoly steerer tube with Hi-ten tapered legs BARS: Hi-ten 2-piece 6.75\" STEM: Forged Alloy top load, 50mm HEADSET: Sealed integrated BRAKE MOUNTS: Removable 990 mounts BRAKES: Alloy lever and U-brake FRONT HUB: Alloy 36h, Sealed bearings, 10mm FRONT RIM: 36h double wall, pinned joint REAR HUB: Alloy 14mm fully sealed 10t cassette REAR RIM: 36h double wall, pinned joint TYRES: Kenda K-Rad 24 x 2.30\", front and rear SPROCKET: Alloy 28t CRANKS: 3-piece Chromoly 170mm tubular with pinch bolt BB: Sealed mid PEDALS: Slim nylon SEAT: Fat seat/post combo GEARING: 28/10 WEIGHT: 28.6lbs ###section### Product Highlights Larger Wheels for that road bike performance with a BMX feel Larger wheels allow for a more comfortable ride without sacrificing too much of that BMX feel Built strong and lightweight Includes sealed bearings Great for cruising ###shogun-image-section###",
